flowchart TD
    A[CRON: Nightly Scan Trigger] --> B[CSO Agent Wakes]
    B --> C[Run dependency audit]
    C --> D{Vulnerabilities found?}
    D -->|No| E[Log clean scan]
    D -->|Yes| F[Assess severity]
    F --> G{Critical/High?}
    G -->|Yes| H[Auto-create patch PR]
    H --> I[Run tests on patch]
    I --> J{Tests pass?}
    J -->|Yes| K[Auto-merge & deploy]
    J -->|No| L[Escalate to CTO]
    G -->|No| M[Add to backlog]
    K --> N[Notify CEO: resolved]
    L --> N
    E --> O[Update security dashboard]
    N --> O
